ional-assembly-session-for-the-first-time-post356063.vnp'>Children with disabilities to participate in mock “Children’s National Assembly” session for the first time</a></li><li><a href='https://en.vietnamplus.vn/project-supports-children-with-disabilities-in-accessing-essential-services-post355274.vnp'>Project supports children with disabilities in accessing essential services</a></li><li><a href='https://en.vietnamplus.vn/new-school-brings-fresh-hopes-to-children-in-border-area-post350839.vnp'>New school brings fresh hopes to children in border area </a></li></ul></div>]]></description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 15:46:41 +07:00</pubDate><updated>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 15:50:19 +07:00</updated><guid>https://en.vietnamplus.vn/vietnam-promotes-asean-cooperation-priorities-on-women-childrens-rights-post356091.vnp</guid><atom:link href="https://en.vietnamplus.vn/vietnam-promotes-asean-cooperation-priorities-on-women-childrens-rights-post356091.vnp" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><link>https://en.vietnamplus.vn/vietnam-promotes-asean-cooperation-priorities-on-women-childrens-rights-post356091.vnp</link><category><![CDATA[Videos]]></category><thumb>https://mediaen.vietnamplus.vn/images/e8z_GMcjfkzBXi4assjTUq6BH79phA4ymHnrF9BotwKMyv1iR6RsyleT9V-SF3t_1BR4HlLKvanHrascEFn9rOVPnzBYIe9VwIYtZuP8tUxe93co3MScc-mrGQSd1xkWcgN3uOlj7_M45hxWuyJnCqkiuqagvGkNk3WLO8U1PBfB5fRJXTFNr8LX1znozR8f/vnanet_potal-hoi-thao-tham-van-quoc-gia-uy-ban-thuc-day-va-bao-ve-quyen-cua-phu-nu-va-tre-em-asean-9179705.jpg.avif</thumb><image>https://mediaen.vietnamplus.vn/images/e8z_GMcjfkzBXi4assjTUq6BH79phA4ymHnrF9BotwKMyv1iR6RsyleT9V-SF3t_1BR4HlLKvanHrascEFn9rOVPnzBYIe9VwIYtZuP8tUxe93co3MScc-mrGQSd1xkWcgN3uOlj7_M45hxWuyJnCqkiuqagvGkNk3WLO8U1PBfB5fRJXTFNr8LX1znozR8f/vnanet_potal-hoi-thao-tham-van-quoc-gia-uy-ban-thuc-day-va-bao-ve-quyen-cua-phu-nu-va-tre-em-asean-9179705.jpg.avif</image></item><item><title><![CDATA[Fuel prices fall from 3 pm on November 26]]></title><description><![CDATA[<a href="https://en.vietnamplus.vn/fuel-prices-fall-from-3-pm-on-november-26-post356090.vnp"><img src="https://mediaen.vietnamplus.vn/images/Wwq8G9OZFp0fOJ6pVy9D8mMCTGTDTsk1BRTU_fhWulzwByEBXXj7j58kXsZ_ovvU/vnanet_fueld.jpg.avif"/></a><p>Under the latest adjustment, E5 RON92 petrol is priced at 18,391 VND (0.71 USD) per litre, down 185 VND from the previous ceiling price and 665 VND below E10 RON95-III.</p><div style="clear:both;"><ul><li><a href='https://en.vietnamplus.vn/fuel-price-cuts-create-room-for-lower-goods-prices-market-stabilisation-post356038.vnp'>Fuel price cuts create room for lower goods prices, market stabilisation</a></li><li><a href='https://en.vietnamplus.vn/vietnam-cuts-fuel-tax-to-zero-petrol-prices-fall-by-up-to-1800-vnd-per-litre-post354639.vnp'>Vietnam cuts fuel tax to zero, petrol prices fall by up to 1,800 VND per litre</a></li><li><a href='https://en.vietnamplus.vn/fuel-prices-rise-from-3pm-on-october-29-post354518.vnp'>Fuel prices rise from 3pm on October 29</a></li></ul></div>]]></description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 15:42:15 +07:00</pubDate><updated>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 15:47:26 +07:00</updated><guid>https://en.vietnamplus.vn/fuel-prices-fall-from-3-pm-on-november-26-post356090.vnp</guid><atom:link href="https://en.vietnamplus.vn/fuel-prices-fall-from-3-pm-on-november-26-post356090.vnp" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><link>https://en.vietnamplus.vn/fuel-prices-fall-from-3-pm-on-november-26-post356090.vnp</link><category><![CDATA[Videos]]></category><thumb>https://mediaen.vietnamplus.vn/images/IMiBwBZ_8NE_cqlcicjxrmMCTGTDTsk1BRTU_fhWulzwByEBXXj7j58kXsZ_ovvU/vnanet_fueld.jpg.avif</thumb><image>https://mediaen.vietnamplus.vn/images/IMiBwBZ_8NE_cqlcicjxrmMCTGTDTsk1BRTU_fhWulzwByEBXXj7j58kXsZ_ovvU/vnanet_fueld.jpg.avif</image></item><item><title><![CDATA[Superstar Michael Bublé to perform at VinFuture Prize Award Ceremony ]]></title><description><![CDATA[<a href="https://en.vietnamplus.vn/superstar-michael-buble-to-perform-at-vinfuture-prize-award-ceremony-post356089.vnp"><img src="https://mediaen.vietnamplus.vn/images/wwn_fz_LCDet4FQOrQWF47ZkybA2PDokgA2wCdsEL78Ry5h0Db6Z7ay_W77cVVOX/picture1.jpg.avif"/></a><p>Under the theme “Science Drives – Prosperity Rises,” the 2026 VinFuture Prize Award Ceremony will honour groundbreaking scientific achievements with the potential to transform billions of lives and contribute to a more prosperous and sustainable future.</p><div style="clear:both;"><ul><li><a href='https://en.vietnamplus.vn/vinfuture-prize-2025-awardees-ignite-scientific-passion-among-youth-post333852.vnp'>VinFuture Prize 2025 awardees ignite scientific passion among youth</a></li><li><a href='https://en.vietnamplus.vn/vinfuture-2025-grand-prize-honours-scientists-for-discoveries-development-of-hpv-vaccines-post333826.vnp'>VinFuture 2025 Grand Prize honours scientists for discoveries, development of HPV vaccines</a></li><li><a href='https://en.vietnamplus.vn/vinfuture-prize-helps-consolidate-trust-in-power-of-science-technology-na-chairman-post333823.vnp'>VinFuture Prize helps consolidate trust in power of science, technology: NA Chairman</a></li></ul></div>]]></description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 15:19:12 +07:00</pubDate><updated>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 15:47:06 +07:00</updated><guid>https://en.vietnamplus.vn/superstar-michael-buble-to-perform-at-vinfuture-prize-award-ceremony-post356089.vnp</guid><atom:link href="https://en.vietnamplus.vn/superstar-michael-buble-to-perform-at-vinfuture-prize-award-ceremony-post356089.vnp" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><link>https://en.vietnamplus.vn/superstar-michael-buble-to-perform-at-vinfuture-prize-award-ceremony-post356089.vnp</link><category><![CDATA[Videos]]></category><thumb>https://mediaen.vietnamplus.vn/images/e8z_GMcjfkzBXi4assjTUrZkybA2PDokgA2wCdsEL78Ry5h0Db6Z7ay_W77cVVOX/picture1.jpg.avif</thumb><image>https://mediaen.vietnamplus.vn/images/e8z_GMcjfkzBXi4assjTUrZkybA2PDokgA2wCdsEL78Ry5h0Db6Z7ay_W77cVVOX/picture1.jpg.avif</image></item></channel></rss>